2. thoughdump
    - Renderservice should not have anything to do with UI render. Renderservice should be the 'make prompts for LLM' service.
        - it should receive the promptctx thing from kb (data) service via the engine, and push it to clipboard via dedicated port
    - TUIService encapsulates incoming and outcoming communication with the user. the exit messages the engine uses should originate from here.

